Date: Fri, 13 Mar 2026 06:38:49 -0500
From: webmaster@rapidcow.org
Subject: Update: Mastodon proxy lifted

mastodon.rapidcow.org is no longer proxied
through Anubis.  This is entirely an impulsive
decision and I entirely blame the irresponsive
domain owner of the domain I want to acquire
for this.  Also I just want to see if
fediverse.observer (which contrary to my belief
appears to be probing us periodically, at least
judging from their site alone) would find us.

This by no means makes mastodon.rapidcow.org
any less "temporary"!
